Author: Adhney Nawghare <96858173+adhney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Mar 9 21:52:54 2026 +0530

    Add qwen3_5_text model type support (#135)
    
    Register qwen3_5_text in LLMTypeRegistry using Qwen35TextConfiguration
    and Qwen35TextModel, following the same pattern as gemma3_text.
    
    This fixes "Unsupported model type: qwen3_5_text" errors when loading
    Qwen 3.5 text-only models.

