commit 6bb84aac13f76ca5e2c3ff312bc072977e684ff4
Author: David Koski <46639364+davidkoski@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Mar 5 20:18:12 2026 -0800

    audit RoPE use across models (#115)
    
    * audit RoPE use across models
    
    - fix bugs related to rope config decode
    - use common RoPE implementation if mlx-lm did
    - fix #110
    
